{
  "id": "vienna-elder-care",
  "title": "老年、药房与旧同事",
  "stage": "elderhood",
  "ageWindow": {
    "min": 60,
    "max": 82
  },
  "tags": [
    "elderhood",
    "health",
    "family",
    "social"
  ],
  "baseRate": 0.3,
  "conditions": [
    {
      "kind": "age",
      "min": 60,
      "max": 82
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "vienna-elder-care.pharmacy-debt",
      "title": "药房账本上的旧名字",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.2,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "health",
          "max": 0.6
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 60,
          "maxAge": 82
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 30,
          "maxAge": 80
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "pay-with-coin-purse",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在药房柜台前数出最后几枚克朗，买下止咳糖浆和一小瓶缬草酊。回家路上在楼梯口歇了两次。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -6,
              "reason": "药房购买止咳糖浆与缬草酊"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.04,
              "reason": "服药后夜间咳嗽减轻"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.05,
              "reason": "邻居在楼梯口扶了一把"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "pay-with-coin-purse",
              "text": "{subject}把硬币排在药房的锌板上，药剂师用纸袋装好糖浆。{neighbor}在楼梯口接过药袋，扶着手肘上到三楼。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-neighbor-for-loan",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}向{neighbor}开口借三克朗垫付药费，邻居迟疑后从围裙口袋里摸出硬币。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 3,
              "reason": "向邻居借的药费"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "obligation": 0.15,
              "trust": 0.05,
              "reason": "借款欠下人情"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "及时取药"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "ask-neighbor-for-loan",
              "text": "{subject}在走廊里拦住{neighbor}，说下周养老金到账就还。{neighbor}数出三枚克朗，说了句“别拖太久”。",
              "tone": [
                "somber"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "skip-medicine",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把药方折好塞回外套内袋，只买了最便宜的松节油膏。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "只买松节油膏"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "咳嗽拖延未治"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "为省钱放弃药方"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "skip-medicine",
              "text": "{subject}把药方折成四折放回内袋，对药剂师摆手说先这样。夜里咳得床板发响，{neighbor}隔着墙听见了。",
              "tone": [
                "somber"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "followupIds": [
        "vienna-elder-care.old-colleague-visit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vienna-elder-care.old-colleague-visit",
      "title": "旧同事带了一瓶葡萄酒",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.2,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasRole",
          "role": "subject"
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 60,
          "maxAge": 82
        },
        {
          "key": "worker",
          "kind": "worker",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 55,
          "maxAge": 85
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "share-bottle-and-stories",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "旧同事{worker}提着半瓶葡萄酒上门，两人在厨房桌边坐到天黑，说起车间里那台老车床。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.08,
              "reason": "旧同事来访聊天"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$worker",
              "kind": "colleague",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "affection": 0.1,
              "reason": "共饮回忆车间岁月"
            },
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 1,
              "reason": "分食面包与香肠"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "share-bottle-and-stories",
              "text": "{worker}把酒瓶往桌上一放，说这是工会最后一次发的。两人用果酱杯分酒，{subject}笑到咳嗽。",
              "tone": [
                "warm"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "mention-pension-fund",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{worker}压低声音说互助基金还有一笔没领，让{subject}下周一起去工会办事处问。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$worker",
              "kind": "colleague",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "reason": "透露互助基金消息"
            },
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "flag": "union_fund_tip",
              "reason": "得知未领的互助金",
              "add": true
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "mention-pension-fund",
              "text": "{worker}把椅子挪近，用手指蘸酒在桌上写了个日期，说“带上你的会员工本”。{subject}把日期抄在旧信封背面。",
              "tone": [
                "tense"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse-and-rest",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}说胸口闷，请{worker}改天再来，把门只开了一条缝。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$worker",
              "kind": "colleague",
              "trust": -0.08,
              "reason": "被拒之门外"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "独自待着的失落"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.02,
              "reason": "躺下休息"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "refuse-and-rest",
              "text": "{subject}扶着门框说今天不行。{worker}把酒瓶放在门槛上就走了，瓶子一直放到第二天。",
              "tone": [
                "somber"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "followupIds": [
        "vienna-elder-care.union-office"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vienna-elder-care.union-office",
      "title": "工会办事处的长凳",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.15,
      "conditions": [],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 60,
          "maxAge": 82
        },
        {
          "key": "official",
          "kind": "official",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 30,
          "maxAge": 70
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "receive-fund-payout",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "办事处职员{official}翻了三本名册，确认{subject}的会员年份，从铁皮箱里数出四十克朗。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 40,
              "reason": "补发互助基金"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$official",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "respect": 0.05,
              "reason": "办事员依规补发"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "receive-fund-payout",
              "text": "{official}把名册转到{subject}面前，指着一行褪色墨水。钱数了两遍，用回形针夹住收据。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "paperwork-blocked",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{official}说缺少雇主盖章的离职工龄证明，让{subject}下周再来一趟。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.06,
              "reason": "白跑一趟"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$official",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.05,
              "reason": "手续被卡"
            },
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "往返电车票"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "paperwork-blocked",
              "text": "{official}用指节敲了敲表格上的空格，说这一栏空着不能办。{subject}攥着表格站在长凳旁，后面排队的人绕过他。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sign-for-small-allowance",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}不想再跑，当场签字领取一次性十二克朗的补助，放弃追讨其余部分。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 12,
              "reason": "一次性补助"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.02,
              "reason": "省去奔波"
            },
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "flag": "union_fund_waived",
              "reason": "放弃追讨余额",
              "add": true
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "sign-for-small-allowance",
              "text": "{subject}在签字栏画了个歪斜的名字，{official}递过十二克朗，把钢笔收回胸袋。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "followupIds": []
    },
    {
      "id": "vienna-elder-care.winter-stairs",
      "title": "结冰的楼梯与面包",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.25,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "householdSize",
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 60,
          "maxAge": 82
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 20,
          "maxAge": 60
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "fall-on-stairs",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在结冰的院子台阶上滑倒，篮子里的面包滚进雪里，右手腕肿了起来。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.12,
              "reason": "楼梯滑倒手腕扭伤"
            },
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -4,
              "reason": "请接骨师包扎"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.08,
              "reason": "邻居扶起并送回家"
            },
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "面包掉在雪里"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "fall-on-stairs",
              "text": "{neighbor}听见闷响从窗户探头，看见{subject}坐在冰上按着手腕。面包被踩进泥雪，{neighbor}跑下来捡起篮子。",
              "tone": [
                "somber"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-neighbor-to-buy-bread",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在楼梯口叫住{neighbor}，托她代买一条黑面包和半升牛奶。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -2,
              "reason": "托邻居代买的食物"
            },
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 2,
              "reason": "黑面包与牛奶"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "reason": "日常托付小事"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "ask-neighbor-to-buy-bread",
              "text": "{subject}把钱和一张写着“黑面包、牛奶”的纸条一起塞给{neighbor}。傍晚她敲门，东西用报纸包着还温。",
              "tone": [
                "warm"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "stay-indoors",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}看了看结冰的台阶，退回屋里，用剩下的面粉和水糊了一顿面糊。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 1,
              "reason": "用余面糊口"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "整日不能出门"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.02,
              "reason": "缺乏新鲜食物"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "stay-indoors",
              "text": "{subject}把窗帘拉开一条缝看院子，台阶上的冰一天没化。锅里的面糊烧糊了底，他刮着吃了一半。",
              "tone": [
                "somber"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "followupIds": []
    }
  ]
}
